    "A stripe that continues around the edge of the body points at early 1968.",
  ],
  [
    "1969",
    "Competition Red, Competition Blue and Competition Orange, with a matching <a class='il' href='#competition'>painted headstock</a>. Standard colours continue alongside.",
    "A headstock painted to match the body is an early Competition feature, not a late one.",
  ],
  [
    "1970 to 1971",
    "The painted headstock gives way to a natural, unpainted maple face on <a class='il' href='#competition'>Competition guitars</a>. Stripes and the black logo continue.",
